1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,692
Omar: Floor four. Mrs. Lin lives here.

2
00:00:03,362 --> 00:00:06,393
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: The Last Floor. Part
two of three: the stairs.

3
00:00:06,713 --> 00:00:10,009
Mrs. Lin: Pip! There you are! Who locked
my stairs?

4
00:00:10,679 --> 00:00:12,382
Bell: I did. Rule one.

5
00:00:12,502 --> 00:00:13,066
Mrs. Lin: ...Fair.

6
00:00:13,736 --> 00:00:16,676
Bell: Go up. Seal the door behind you.

7
00:00:17,346 --> 00:00:20,848
Omar: Floor four, five, six... that's a
lot of floors.

8
00:00:20,968 --> 00:00:22,549
Zara: Keep climbing. Don't count.

9
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:25,417
Zara: Floor five. The stairs are blocked!

10
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:28,738
Bell: Push! Everyone push!

11
00:00:29,408 --> 00:00:30,446
Zara: ...Direct hit.

12
00:00:31,116 --> 00:00:34,196
Mrs. Lin: That's my sister's flat. She
says never open it.

13
00:00:34,866 --> 00:00:36,839
Mrs. Lin: Dot, you're not well.

14
00:00:37,509 --> 00:00:39,887
Bell: Leave her. Lock the door.

15
00:00:40,557 --> 00:00:42,297
Mrs. Lin: Goodbye, Dot. Click.

16
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:45,260
Zara: They're gaining. Floor seven.

17
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,781
Omar: Twelve floors. My legs filed a
complaint.

18
00:00:49,451 --> 00:00:53,171
Bell: Shortcut! Through the floor ten
hall!

19
00:00:53,841 --> 00:01:00,467
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part two of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the roof. Follow for part three.

